::  name       lantern face text budget gate
::  shape      text bytes - int (@u32) -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers 1 while text stays at or under max-face-text=38 bytes; answers 0 past it
::  law        pond/apps/lantern_face.rye max_face_text atmost
::  example    38 -> 1 - 39 -> 0
::  readers    Lantern - Realidream - Glow
::  nib        lantern-face-v0 - the asking voice's wall spoken in Glow (20260829)
::
::  A face row leads with a two-byte voice mark on the forty-column proof grid, so
::  its text budget is thirty-eight bytes -- max_face_text in
::  pond/apps/lantern_face.rye, refused by name rather than clipped. This desk is
::  that wall made runnable in Glow; the witness holds the two spellings to one
::  number so neither drifts alone.
|=  sample=@u32
?:  (gth sample 38)  0  1
